# gpt-oss:20b as the JUDGE. Independent of the miner, which is the whole point
# of this bundle: qwen3.6:27b mines, gpt-oss:20b grades. Neither model scores
# its own output.
#
# Weights are ~13.8 GB. At 16K context the KV cache adds roughly 1 GB, so this
# fits comfortably alongside a 16K KV cache. Do NOT raise num_ctx without checking
# `ollama ps` afterwards -- once the split stops reading 100% GPU, throughput
# falls off a cliff.
#
# 16K is chosen from the judge prompts themselves: ~1.2K tokens for a single
# code, ~3K for a 5-code bag. The reason not to shrink further is that a
# truncated prompt fails SILENTLY.
#
#   ollama create gpt-oss-judge -f Modelfile.gpt-oss-judge

FROM gpt-oss:20b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
